209 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (EN: Hypothesis & Assumption Diagnostics: A One-Way ANOVA confirmed that TV Budget has an extremely significant impact on sales \(F = 1971.46, p < 0.001$\), while Influencer Size showed no statistical significance \(F = 1.52, p = 0.207$\). Model residuals fulfill the core ANOVA assumptions: the histogram and Q-Q plot reveal a symmetric, light-tailed normal distribution \(Kurtosis = 1.775\), while the Residuals vs. Fitted plot demonstrates a highly uniform vertical spread across all groups, validating the assumption of homoscedasticity \(equal variances\). Given the robust sample size \($N = 569$\) and the Central Limit Theorem, our statistical inferences are highly reliable for executive decision-making.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
